  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kofi Annan Int. Peacekeeping Training Centre KAIPTC support 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding for the Kofi Annan International Peacekeeping Training Centre. The main objectives are therefore given in the Centre&#x2019;s five-year Strategic Plan for 2024-2028. However, the grant shall only be funding activities applicable to OECD &#x2013; DAC requirements. The plan was developed in close dialogue with partners and the Governing Board and builds on insights from the former strategic plan. Norway was the sole core funder throughout the previous strategic period (2018-2023). The Centre&apos;s mission is to provide globally recognised capacity for all actors on African peace and security through training, education, research, and policy dialogues to foster peace and stability in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
